{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れちま(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は京都で個別握手会でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都は雨が降ったり止んだりと不安定な気候でしたが、来て下さったふぁみりーのみなさん、ありがとうございました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぁみりーさんとお話もでき、握手もできて、とっても楽しい時間を過ごせました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと一緒にいたかったなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日来られなかったふぁみりーさんへのレポート☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の私服は、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抹茶カラーのセットアップ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都だから、抹茶カラーにしました( ^ω^ )笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして髪型は、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフアップ編み込み♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人っぽくしてもらいました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもたくさん握手会はあるので、みなさんにお会いできるのを、ひなちまってます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きな八ッ橋...ぱくり♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木ここで、川後Pに「ニセ京都人」と名付けられてしまいましたが...\n京都について、これからもっとお勉強していきます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、待ち時間にメンバーとたくさん2ショットを撮りました♪\nこれからのブログで少しづつ載せていきます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めは..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑2期生のまいちゅんと(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お姉さんなまいちゅん＊\n大好きです(////)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度ゆっくりお話したいなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【9月1日きょーさんのたくやさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【9月2日しんちゃん☆】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【9月3日たっちゃん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆HAPPY BIRTHDAY☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な一年になります様に☆ﾟ'･:*☆♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ！\n日奈は明日から学校が始まります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気持ちを入れ替えて、頑張ります☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/09/01/3929347/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"